program ParcelPrice

Prices a parcel for delivery.

interface
  input  parcel: { weightGrams: integer, lengthCm: integer, express?: boolean }
  output cents: integer

Requirement 1: Base rate
  THE SYSTEM SHALL charge five cents for every gram of weight

Requirement 2: Oversize
  IF the parcel length is above 100 cm THEN the system SHALL add a surcharge of 1000 cents

Requirement 3: Express
  WHERE express delivery is requested, THE SYSTEM SHALL double the cost
